'''''Tranquil Amidst Turmoil''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Windswept Wanderlust]].

==Steps==
# Pass through the empty delve
# Defeat the mara-struck and save the injured girl
# Follow Xueyi and examine the strange happenings here

